1600&h=900\">\n        </picture><small>Credit:&#160;Lucas Gouveia / Android Police</small></figure>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n                                                     </header>\n\n                                        \n            \n\n            \n                                                    \n    \n    <div>\n\n                            <div data-nosnippet=\"\">\n                                                                                                                                                                                <a href=\"/author/chandra-steele/\">\n                                    <picture>\n                                        <source media=\"(max-width: 480px)\" srcset=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress%2Fwp-content%2Fauthors%2F68a355fa2011d-ChandraSteelePhoto.jpg?fit=crop&w=36&h=36\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\">\n                                        <img src=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress%2Fwp-content%2Fauthors%2F68a355fa2011d-ChandraSteelePhoto.jpg?fit=crop&w=90&h=90\" alt=\"4\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\">\n                                    </picture>\n                                </a>\n                                                    </div>\n                        <div>\n                                                                                \n                                    \n                \n                                                                                                                                    <p><time datetime=\"2026-09-16T21:49:00Z\"><span>Published</span> Sep 16, 2026, 5:49 PM EDT</time>\n                        </p>\n                                    \n                                \n                \n            </div>\n                                            \n                                \n                                    <p>Chandra Steele has been writing about tech for the entirety of <a href=\"https://authory.com/ChandraSteele\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">her journalism career</a>. She loves making tough topics easy to understand. Before joining Android Police, Chandra was senior features writer at PCMag where she did everything from interviewing Jeff Goldblum to explaining crypto.&#160; </p>\n                            \n        </div>\n\n\n            <a id=\"login-button-article-sidebar\">\n            <p>Sign in to your <span>Android Police</span> account</p>\n            \n        </a>\n                \n                                                        \n            \n                                                            \n                                            \n                \n                \n                \n            \n            \n\n        \n                        \n        \n                                                                                            \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n                                                                        \n                                    \n        \n        \n                \n                    \n             