       \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n        \n                \n                    \n                            \n                                                    \n                                    \n                                                \n                        \n    <div data-img-url=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/google-smart-home-devices-with-gemini-and-google-home-icons-and-an-alert-symbol.png\" data-modal-id=\"single-image-modal\" data-modal-container-id=\"single-image-modal-container\" data-img-caption=\"&quot;Lucas Gouveia \\/ Android Police&quot;\" data-is-feature-img=\"true\">\n        \n        <figure><picture><source media=\"(max-width: 480px)\" data-srcset=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/google-smart-home-devices-with-gemini-and-google-home-icons-and-an-alert-symbol.png?q=49&fit=crop&w=600&h=338&dpr=2\" srcset=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/google-smart-home-devices-with-gemini-and-google-home-icons-and-an-alert-symbol.png?q=49&fit=crop&w=600&h=338&dpr=2\">\n        <source media=\"(min-width: 481px)\" data-srcset=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/google-smart-home-devices-with-gemini-and-google-home-icons-and-an-alert-symbol.png?q=70&fit=crop&w=1600&h=900&dpr=1\" srcset=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/google-smart-home-devices-with-gemini-and-google-home-icons-and-an-alert-symbol.png?q=70&fit=crop&w=1600&h=900&dpr=1\">\n        <img width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" alt=\"Google smart home devices with Gemini and Google Home icons and an alert symbol.\" data-img-url=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/google-smart-home-devices-with-gemini-and-google-home-icons-and-an-alert-symbol.png?&fit=crop&w=1600&h=900\" src=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/google-smart-home-devices-with-gemini-and-google-home-icons-and-an-alert-symbol.png?&fit=crop&w=1600&h=900\">\n        </picture><small>Credit:&#160;Lucas Gouveia / Android Police</small></figure>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n                                                     </header>\n\n                                        \n            \n\n            \n                                                    \n    \n    <div>\n\n                            <div data-nosnippet=\"\">\n                                                                                                                                                                                <a href=\"/author/chandra-steele/\">\n                                    <picture>\n                                        <source media=\"(max-width: 480px)\" srcset=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress%2Fwp-content%2Fauthors%2F68a355fa2011d-ChandraSteelePhoto.jpg?fit=crop&w=36&h=36\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\">\n                                        <img src=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress%2Fwp-content%2Fauthors%2F68a355fa2011d-ChandraSteelePhoto.jpg?fit=crop&w=90&h=90\" alt=\"4\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\">\n                                    </picture>\n                                </a>\n                                                    </div>\n                        <div>\n                                                                                \n                                    \n                \n                                                                                                                                    <p>Published Sep 16, 2026, 5:49 PM EDT</p>\n                                    \n                                \n                \n            </div>\n                                            \n                                \n                                    <p>钱德拉·斯蒂尔（Chandra Steele）在她的整个新闻职业生涯中一直在撰写有关科技的文章。 她喜欢让困难的话题变得容易理解。 在加入 Android Police 之前，Chandra 是 PCMag 的高级专题撰稿人，她负责从采访 Jeff Goldblum 到解释加密货币等各种事务。</p>\n                            \n        </div>\n\n\n            <a id=\"login-button-article-sidebar\">\n            <p>登录您的 Android Police 帐户</p>\n            \n        </a>\n                \n                                                        \n            \n                                                            \n                                            \n                \n                \n                \n            \n            \n\n        \n                        \n        \n                                                                                            \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n                                                                        \n                                    \n        \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                                                                \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                                                                                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                                                                                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                                                                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                    \n    \n    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                    \n\n\n\t\t\n\n\n\n\n                                        <!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! -->\n\n                \n<div itemprop=\"articleBody\" id=\"article-body\"><p>Google announced that it’s giving Google Home access to any agent that supports calling Model Context Protocol (MCP). This includes ChatGPT, Claude, Hermes, and OpenClaw. The agents can control devices, analyze summaries, and build custom dashboards. It also lets an AI agent use a Google Home speaker as its “voice.”</p>    <!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! -->\n\n\n\n            \n    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n                                        \n    \n        \n    \n        \n                \n        \n                        \n    \n<!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id=\"a-bigger-neighborhood-for-google-home\">A bigger neighborhood for Google Home</h2>\n<p>The abilities extend to all devices in the Google Home ecosystem, including Nest devices, Matter devices, and anything labeled “Works with Google Home.”</p>    <p>The announcement was made in a blog post by Taylor Lehman, product manager atr Google Home &amp; Nest. Lehman said it is “just the next step in unlocking agentic smart homes.”</p>    <p>Right now though, access is only available to those in the US with its $20 per month Google Home Premium Advanced subscription. Google said it’s “rolling out,” which generally means about one to two weeks for it to extend to all eligible devices and users.</p>    <!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id=\"how-to-set-up-google-home-mcp\">How to set up Google Home MCP</h2>\n<p>If you have a Google Home Premium Advanced subscription and want to get started with using your AI agent of choice, you’ll need to create a Google Cloud project.</p>    <p>Then you can configure it to use MCP by providing the MCP configuration details to your agent and asking it to set it up. The agent should then ask you to sign in and grant permissions.</p>    <p>Complete setup guides are available in the Google Home Developer Center.</p>    <!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id=\"opens-up-homes-to-new-security-concerns\">Opens up homes to new security concerns</h2>\n<p>Giving an AI agent access to smart home controls doesn’t come without risks. Privacy and security issues abound when you’re talking about devices that watch and listen outside and inside homes, control lights and appliances, and run HVAC systems.</p>    \n\n                \n<p>The post said that Home MCP does prohibit some sensitive actions, such as unlocking doors. “However, depending on your agent, connecting it to Home MCP can result in unexpected or even undesired behavior,” Lehman wrote.</p>    </div>\n    \n            \n                        \n                \n        \n        \n\n                    \n    \n                        \n    \n\n\n            \n                                \n        \n        \n    \n\n        \n    </article>\n\n    \n            \n        </div></div>"}